{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Version Specifications</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play up to <strong>Stage 1-8</strong> of the main game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Saving is not available</strong> in the Demo version, and progress <strong>cannot be carried over</strong> to the full game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A One-Button Jump Action Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick to play, quick to clear! If you don't have much time but still want a thrilling experience, <strong>JETMAN</strong> is the game for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Jump and Defeat Enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The height of your jump varies depending on how long you hold the button. Time your jumps carefully to land the perfect attack! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868340/extras/STEAM_GIF_01.gif?t=1739634390\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Over 50 Unique Enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wide variety of enemies with distinct appearances and movement patterns await. Observe their behaviors and strategize for an efficient victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868340/extras/STEAM_GIF_02.gif?t=1739634390\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade Your Character with JP (Junk Points)!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the points earned in battles to power up your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you <strong>boost your attack</strong> or <strong>reinforce your defense</strong>? The choice is yours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868340/extras/STEAM_GIF_03.gif?t=1739634390\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Story Full of Colorful Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created by Dr. Ark to stop the evil <strong>Violets Organization</strong>, Jet\u2014a half-android hero\u2014takes center stage in this action-packed adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868340/extras/Characters.png?t=1739634390\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Post-Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clearing the main story unlocks <strong>special game modes</strong>. Dive deeper into the world of <strong>JETMAN</strong> and enjoy the full experience!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1868340?t=1739634390","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1868340?t=1739634390","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868340/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739634390","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868340/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739634390","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Version Specifications</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play up to <strong>Stage 1-8</strong> of the main game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Saving is not available</strong> in the Demo version, and progress <strong>cannot be carried over</strong> to the full game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A One-Button Jump Action Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick to play, quick to clear! If you don't have much time but still want a thrilling experience, <strong>JETMAN</strong> is the game for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Jump and Defeat Enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The height of your jump varies depending on how long you hold the button. Time your jumps carefully to land the perfect attack! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868340/extras/STEAM_GIF_01.gif?t=1739634390\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Over 50 Unique Enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wide variety of enemies with distinct appearances and movement patterns await. Observe their behaviors and strategize for an efficient victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868340/extras/STEAM_GIF_02.gif?t=1739634390\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade Your Character with JP (Junk Points)!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the points earned in battles to power up your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you <strong>boost your attack</strong> or <strong>reinforce your defense</strong>? The choice is yours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868340/extras/STEAM_GIF_03.gif?t=1739634390\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Story Full of Colorful Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created by Dr. Ark to stop the evil <strong>Violets Organization</strong>, Jet\u2014a half-android hero\u2014takes center stage in this action-packed adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868340/extras/Characters.png?t=1739634390\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Post-Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clearing the main story unlocks <strong>special game modes</strong>. Dive deeper into the world of <strong>JETMAN</strong> and enjoy the full experience!</p>","developers":["Montblanc Hatch"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1596030","name":"JETMAN"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868340/header.jpg?t=1739634390","is_free":true,"l